	<HelpLink></HelpLink>
	<Help>Gives site administrators a single portal to browse, install, upgrade, and remove addon collections without leaving the admin interface. The Collection Library connects to the Contensive addon catalog so you can discover available addons, see which are already installed, and install or upgrade with one click. Upload lets you install collections from a zip file, Export packages any installed collection for transfer to another site, and Uninstall cleanly removes a collection along with its addons and navigator entries. Version awareness highlights when upgrades are available and warns if a collection requires a newer platform version.</Help>
